# TIER 1 - continuation of a stalled OptTS from its final frame
# Use when an OptTS run hit MaxIter with the energy still descending.
# Geometry = the FINAL structure of the previous run (optts_bandX_ci.xyz),
# exact Hessian rebuilt (Calc_Hess true), 300 more steps.
# Watch the IMAGINARY MODE COUNT trajectory, not the energy.
# Launch only through cmd:
#   cmd /c "D:\ORCA_6.1.0\orca.exe optts2_bandX_ci.inp > optts2_bandX_ci.out"

! XTB2 OPTTS FREQ

%geom
  Calc_Hess true
  MaxIter 300
end

%pal nprocs 1 end

* xyzfile 0 1 optts_bandX_ci.xyz
